DESCRIPTION:Join us this fall for three films that ask what it means to be
  human in a world where people and machines are becoming increasingly inte
 rtwined. For the first time\, our Rigorously Curated Film Festival is bein
 g screened in the Main Hall of The Lindemann Performing Arts Center\, and 
