DESCRIPTION:Take a student-led tour of the exhibitions currently on view a
 t the Brady Art Gallery: "Unfossilizing African Art" and "Cracks and Refor
 ms". Unfossilizing African Art recontextualizes African material culture o
 bjects that have been held in the GW Collection for nearly 50 years. Led b
