DESCRIPTION:We Hold These Truths is an Out of Hand series that invites you
  to share your story and your hopes and dreams for the future of our count
 ry as America marks the 250th anniversary of the Declaration of Independen
 ce. Ancestral Reckoning\, written by Marcie Rendon and performed by CT May
 o\, is one of four plays in the series. This performance is hosted by Ogle
 thorpe University. The play follows the ancestors’ prophecy of what was 
 to come\, from the arrival of the pale people to a spider web around the p
 lanet to a choice that must be made of which road to walk\, the ancestral 
