DESCRIPTION:We Hold These Truths is an Out of Hand series that invites you
  to share your story and your hopes and dreams for the future of our count
 ry as America marks the 250th anniversary of the Declaration of Independen
 ce. Faded Dream\, written by Melissa Simmons and performed by Reed Willard
 \, is one of four plays in the series. This performance is hosted by Tiger
  Club The play follows Cole\, a newly unemployed man waiting in line at a 
 food pantry\, as he wrestles with mounting financial pressure. As his disi
 llusionment grows\, he is forced to confront what\, if anything\, the Amer
 ican Dream still promises 250 years after the nation’s founding. Events 
 are FREE and follow our award-winning Dinners format: *\nCategory: Theater
