DESCRIPTION:Join the GW Department of American Studies for part one of our
  2026-27 Mergen-Palmer Distinguished Lecture Series featuring Justin Mann
 \, associate professor of English at Northwestern University\, and a GW Am
 erican Studies PhD alum. This event has been rescheduled and will now be h
 osted virtually via Zoom. “Getting Lost in the Dark” analyzes two text
 s\, Victor La Valle and Dietrich Smith’s graphic novel Destroyer and the
  Russo brothers' Captain America: The Winter Soldier \, to show how Black 
 speculative fictions reimagine the possibilities\, limits and potential en
 ds of the American security state.\nCategory: Academic\nOriginal listing: 
