 ates
DESCRIPTION:Al Gore and Rep. Maxwell Frost discuss climate\, democracy\, a
 ffordability and their hopes for the future. Twenty years ago\, former Vic
 e President Al Gore and The Climate Reality Project set out to turn everyd
 ay citizens into leaders. Today\, we find ourselves posing the question: w
