  a festive Christmas Eve party through a battle with the Mouse King and in
 to the sparkling Land of Sweets. Choreography by Rise City Dance’s creat
 ive team brings the story to life with lively characters\, beautiful danci
 ng\, and moments of wonder. Gather family and friends for a holiday tradit
 ion presented in two acts with one intermission. Join the\nCategory: Dance
