SUMMARY:F*CK THIS\, I’M GOING TO CHURCH — Atlanta
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261127T200000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-05:00":20261127T220000
DTSTAMP:20261112T195859Z
UID:0ee42717efabdac9e64771dbf5f7@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Theater\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Virginia-Highland Church is proud to present an all new experi
 mental theatre performance devised by local artists titled F*CK THIS\, I
 ’M GOING TO CHURCH taking place at Virginia-Highland Church every weeken
 d of March. March 06 – March 28\, 2026 Fridays at 8:00pm Saturdays at 3:
 00pm and 7:00pm F*CK THIS\, I’M GOING TO CHURCH is an immersive\, experi
