DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Hispanic Heritage Month with Atlanta’s original al
 l-Hispanic improv cast! Every Friday at 10 PM\, Whole World Improv Theatre
  presents a unique\, fully improvised show celebrating Latin culture and s
 torytelling. From spooky musical comedy to real-life stories brought to th
 e stage\, no two Fridays are ever the same. Sept 18th – El Armando: Una 
 historia real se convierte en una obra completamente improvisada. / A real
  story becomes a completely improvised play. Sept 25th – Whole World Gig
 ante: Talentos hispanos de Atlanta\, reunidos en un solo escenario. / Atla
 nta’s Hispanic talent\, united on one stage. Oct 2nd – Caos Musical: U
 n musical 100% improvisado. / A 100% improvised musical. Oct \nCategory: T
