  the United States Join us for a fireside chat with the Honorable John Jov
 anovic \, President and Chairman of the Export-Import Bank of the United S
 tates (EXIM)\, moderated by Michael Moore \, GW Professor of Economics and
  International Affairs\, with welcome remarks by Alyssa Ayres \, Dean of t
 he Elliott School of International Affairs. The conversation will explore 
