 am (Austin Community College) “Cornered by the DEA\, convicted New York 
 drug dealer Montgomery Brogan reevaluates his life in the 24 remaining hou
 rs before facing a seven-year jail term” (25TH HOUR logline). Based on D
 avid Benioff’s book of the same title\, Spike Lee’s 25TH HOUR pays hom
 age to the city of New York post 9/11. “Lee spans all of the five boroug
 hs in this film. In his visits to Brooklyn\, Queens\, Staten Island\, Manh
 attan and the Bronx\, his camera focuses on symbols that glorify the riche
 st city in the nation. Lady Liberty gets a shot from a Staten Island spot.
