CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Books\,Atlanta\,United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us for UDHR Day at the National Center for Civil and Huma
 n Rights and enjoy free admission all day\, generously supported by The Ho
 me Depot Foundation. UDHR Day commemorates the adoption of the Universal D
 eclaration of Human Rights\, a landmark document affirming the rights and 
 dignity of all people. Visitors of all ages are invited to explore the Cen
 ter’s immersive exhibitions\, engage with powerful stories of courage an
 d change\, and reflect on the ongoing pursuit of justice\, freedom\, and e
 quality around the world.\nCategory: Books\nOriginal listing: https://www.
 artsatl.org/event/udhr-day-sponsored-by-the-home-depot-foundation/
