 s
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum on select Saturday mornings for Studio K
 IDS! and Little Learners youth art-making workshops. In these workshop ser
 ies designed for artists ages 4-5 (Little Learners) and 6-12 (Studio KIDS!
 )\, we’ll take inspiration from works on view across the museum and the 
 Besthoff Sculpture Garden and make our own creations with a teaching artis
 t. About Little Learners: Puppet Party Play with puppets! Participants wil
 l explore the galleries and search for animals\, characters\, and stories.
  Inspired by what they discover\, artists will then create their own artic
 ulated puppets. Registration is $15 for members and $20 for other particip
 ants. Advance registration is required and includes \nCategory: Kids &amp
 \; Families\nOriginal listing: https://noma.org/event/little-learners-pupp
 et-party/
