SUMMARY:Studio KIDS!: Puppet Party — New Orleans
DTSTART;TZID="UTC-06:00":20261212T103000
DTEND;TZID="UTC-06:00":20261212T120000
DTSTAMP:20261112T195859Z
UID:3f2a783875fd5397d4cad2cb0415@global-arts-culture
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture\,Kids &amp\; Families\,New Orleans\,United State
 s
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the museum on select Saturday mornings for Studio K
 IDS! and Little Learners youth art-making workshops. In these workshop ser
 ies designed for artists ages 4-5 (Little Learners) and 6-12 (Studio KIDS!
 )\, we’ll take inspiration from works on view across the museum and the 
 Besthoff Sculpture Garden and make our own creations with a teaching artis
 t. About Studio KIDS!: Puppet Party Play with puppets! Participants will e
 xplore the galleries and search for animals\, characters\, and stories. In
 spired by what they discover\, artists will then create their own imaginat
